; tests/gen-neutral-code-band.fk — a generator: one IR, one renderer, languages
; as data. Not a counting loop, and not a template.
;
; PROOF LEVEL: SIBLINGS ONLY — walk_recipe is registered in Go/Rust/TS and
; absent from fkwu's --src door. (The refusal marker here is the empty string,
; not `nothing`, because `nothing?` is fkwu-only: a cell needing both ops would
; be runnable on no arm at all.)
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk cognition/language-neutral-symbol-identity.fk cognition/steiner-neutral-kernel.fk cognition/gen-neutral-code.fk
;
; Verdict 8388607 — twenty-three readings, on Go / Rust / TypeScript:
;   the shape table is TOTAL over the IR — every node kind has a shape in
;     every registered language, so "any PL" is a checked claim               1
;   an unregistered language has no shape                                     2
;   and emits nothing at all, rather than text with a hole in it              4
;   Form emission is substantial                                              8
;   Python emission is substantial                                           16
;   JavaScript emission is substantial                                       32
;   Form and Python differ — one IR, genuinely different syntax              64
;   Python and JavaScript differ                                            128
;   THE GENERATED FORM RUNS, and agrees with the graph read directly        256
;   it returns 4 for the fourfold being                                     512
;   and 0 for a concept with no members — the recursion bottoms out to a
;     bare 0 with no emptiness special-case in the generator               1024
;   the table is total over VOCABULARY as well as syntax                   2048
;   and the operator spelling is the language's: eq is "==" in Python      4096
;   THE DATA IS NOT IN THE PROGRAM — the emitted function mentions no
;     fact and no node id; the graph is a parameter                       8192
;   the function form is substantial in Python and JavaScript            16384
;   a builtin the language does not name REFUSES rather than splicing
;     a hole — the failure the review panel found                        32768
;   every language that names a builtin it lacks SHIPS it: Python and
;     JavaScript carry a runtime prelude, Form needs none               65536
;   and the emitted module is larger than the function alone           131072
;   PRECEDENCE replaces frozen parens: Form is prefix and needs no rule,
;     Python is infix and does                                          262144
;   and add binds tighter than eq, so the printer wraps only what must
;     be wrapped                                                        524288
;   the RELATION-PARAMETERISED query emits in every language — one
;     program for every relation, not one per question               1048576
;   and it still carries no data                                     2097152
;   LEVERAGE is a number greater than one: answerable questions over
;     authored table rows. 180 over 51 today. The way to raise it by
;     orders of magnitude is to keep moving variation out of code and
;     into arguments — which is what this whole layer did twice      4194304
